
### 1. Cadastrar funcionário
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Roberto",
    "email": "roberto@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}


### 2. Fazer login (armazena o token automaticamente)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "roberto@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}


### 3. Cadastrar fornecedor
POST http://localhost:3000/fornecedor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Tech Distribuidora",
    "cpf": "12345678000199",
    "email": "contato@tech.com",
    "telefone": "47999999999"
}


### 4. Cadastrar outro fornecedor
POST http://localhost:3000/fornecedor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Brasil Atacado",
    "cpf": "98765432000188",
    "email": "contato@brasil.com",
    "telefone": "47988888888"
}


### 5. Cadastrar terceiro fornecedor
POST http://localhost:3000/fornecedor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Global Produtos",
    "cpf": "11222333000144",
